# design goal

1.the target design should have two actual resonance frequencies: one at 2.45 ghz and one at 4.50 ghz. at each fixed target frequency, the measured s11 must be no higher than -15.00 db.
2.Based only on the highest-ranking top-20 evaluated sample summaries, generate exactly 2 legal candidate designs intended to improve resonance positions and target-frequency S11 so that the candidates satisfy the design goal.
